#: 5a221e29b1d346a0bab2d4de8fa1c8cf
msgid "This article shows how to setup CAN bus and what options users have to accomplish the setup suitable for their specific needs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:12
